{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15210310","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210310","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1521031001:0":{"text":"小公子，您怎么……","source_cn":"小公子，您怎么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0464710B01D34CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521031002:0":{"text":"我想知道卡托刚刚想问什么。唔……还有你说的那些流言。","source_cn":"我想知道卡托刚刚想问什么。唔……还有你说的那些流言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80924A95CA75963C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521031003:0":{"text":"不管你们说什么，我都不会生气——呃，也不会告诉其他人。","source_cn":"不管你们说什么，我都不会生气——呃，也不会告诉其他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16D5937E5F5CD163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521031004:0":{"text":"……真的吗？","source_cn":"……真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7634858F19B91C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521031005:1":{"text":"卡托……","source_cn":"卡托……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8B9463FA02EEDCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521031006:1":{"text":"你这样说，肯定是见过领主殿下，对不对？","source_cn":"你这样说，肯定是见过领主殿下，对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC40C97D9809FCCC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521031007:0":{"text":"嗯，见过。你想认识他吗？","source_cn":"嗯，见过。你想认识他吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA84C2083662A3FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521031008:0":{"text":"我、我只是想问……领主殿下是不是真像传闻中说的那样，是一个和我年纪差不多的小孩？","source_cn":"我、我只是想问……领主殿下是不是真像传闻中说的那样，是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFDA65496C8DAA38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521031009:0":{"text":"——对了，我今年七岁！","source_cn":"——对了，我今年七岁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF725FC66B6E8A1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521031010:0":{"text":"你没见过领主吗？领主经常在广场上玩……呃，体察民情！对，他经常出来体察民情。","source_cn":"你没见过领主吗？领主经常在广场上玩……呃，体察民情！对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22F0EC278E0E38D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521031011:0":{"text":"没有，我从来没见过领主殿下……","source_cn":"没有，我从来没见过领主殿下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01A82B8FE848426B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index"